{"unit_id":"flynow-harness__dsh-plugin-agent-workflow#card-zh","repo":"flynow-harness/dsh-plugin-agent-workflow","commit":"b170a72f690efe30b7d151b83e7af1092dfc90b4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Agent Workflow（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：按用户对话轮次查看 Agent 的模型请求、响应和工具调用。它在 conversation.view 槽位注册独立的“工作流”标签页，从 Session 与 Trajectory 视图构建执行链路。可浏览轮次和耗时、检查请求消息与工具定义、查看响应和工具执行状态，并查看 Token 统计。适合需要理解 DSH 会话中每次模型与工具执行过程的用户。无需额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:48-64","src/client/WorkflowView.tsx:1-32","src/client/workflow-model.ts:1-100"]}
